# Cold Aisle: Edge league, track 1. Driven clockwise on the map image:
# the long top straight east, back west through the upper esses, a
# hairpin, east through the open sweeping S (no rails), down the hot
# chicane, the bottom run west, then the cold-aisle pit strip north up the
# west side to the line. Control point 0 is the start line. Features on
# point i apply to the segment from point i to point i+1; a segment
# without `open` has rails.
league edge
width 64
# x    y    half   features
 480  150   64     pad             # start line; overclock pad mid-straight
 850  150   60                     # long right-hander
 880  310   52
 600  300   48                     # upper esses, heading west
 290  350   48                     # into the hairpin
 290  510   44
 560  490   52     open            # sweeping S, no rail: leave it and fall
 850  540   52     open
 830  690   50                     # down the right side
 880  840   52     hot:3           # three hot spots through the last bend
 690  905   60                     # bottom run west over a gentle rise
 420  810   56
 170  860   56     cold            # cold aisle pit strip up the west side
 180  150   60
